{"detail": {"templateUuid": "250858cfb18b4a96abb11fc03455eef9", "projectUuid": "f5a4c39e0d6445c290b8cebdb2900166", "name": "载着后座的风", "description": "如何用AIGC做一只广告片呢？\n不要炫技，不要参数，不要那种“你值得拥有”的呐喊\n那天试着《载着后座的风》\n一个女人开着车，路过五个地方，路过了自己的半生。\n我从地理上虚构了五座城——风港、梅屿、甘玛拉、鹿谷寮、蓝泊。\n五个地名，五个记忆的坐标。\n一辆车，一个女人的半个世纪。\n你问我，这跟车有什么关系。\n有：车是容器。车是那个始终在场的沉默陪伴。\n这次不是硬广，而是为审美写了一封情书。\n几个cue的关键词：\nNight Market Reverie（夜市幻梦）、Midnight Cinema（午夜电影院）、Manila Bay（马尼拉湾）、Whisper of the Unseen（看不见的低语）、Foghorn on the Harbor Road（海港路的雾笛）", "coverUrl": "/assets/f9a45463a36b4871.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d4a7a9586c13499a8538afa624ab8430/4049df2a3ae8c5bcdba7552848dd4c6d516931f4.mp4", "snapshotId": 24129, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 5919496, "ownerUuid": "d4a7a9586c13499a8538afa624ab8430", "avatar": "/assets/3e3bb6164390ba95.webp", "nickname": "有無劇院", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 120, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3042, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-故事短片", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3042", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1101, "code": "product_show", "tagLabel": "产品展示", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1101/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verif